flowchart LR
    Code[Source + Dockerfile] --> Build[Docker build]
    Build --> Tag[Tag image]
    Tag --> ECR[(ECR)]
    ECR --> Revision[Task-definition revision references image]
    Revision --> Service[ECS service deployment]
    Service --> Task[New running ECS tasks]
    Task --> Health[Task/container and target health]
    Health --> Target[Gateway target group]
    Previous[Prior known-good revision/image] -. rollback .-> Service
